# Pillar ownership for helios-cli
#
# Mirrors `.github/CODEOWNERS` semantically but is keyed by pillar rather than
# by file path. Pillar owners are responsible for:
#   * keeping the scorecard honest
#   * filing remediation work items when their pillar drops below target
#   * reviewing changes that materially affect their pillar
#
# Multiple owners per pillar are encouraged; the first listed owner is the
# accountable lead for sprint planning purposes.

